src/decode.ts is a TypeScript port of the advertisement parsers of
pySwitchbot (https://github.com/sblibs/pySwitchbot): switchbot/adv_parser.py,
switchbot/adv_parsers/{_sensor_th,meter,hub2,hub3,hubmini_matter,weather_station,
motion,contact,presence_sensor}.py and switchbot/const/presence_sensor.py.
Its test advertisements (tests/test_adv_parser.py) are used in
src/decode.test.ts. pySwitchbot's licence:

